# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dataset (PlantVillage) — ~87k images, downloaded separately, never committed.
# See the Dataset section of README.md for the expected layout.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
train/
valid/
test/
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Model checkpoints
# The two .keras files in this repo are committed on purpose (the app loads
# them at runtime), so *.keras is deliberately NOT ignored. Everything else a
# training run spits out is.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pb
*.tflite
*.onnx
*.ckpt
*.ckpt.*
checkpoints/
saved_model/
logs/
runs/
tensorboard/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
